{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pcm1dKcpXD1795705865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>特區護照缺頁案，入境處拘捕兩名男女，涉嫌非法改動護照。</p><p></p><p>早前有市民聲稱特區護照出現缺頁，被日本拒絕入境。入境處深夜見記者，指涉案護照發現經人為改動，而該護照已發出八年，曾使用前往多地。</p><p></p><p>被捕的一對男女，據報為情侶關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.693353+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:57:19.770739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:18.665348+00:00","content_hash":"4f557efdce0bd0cd510663c86ea3b41ea1dfe799af45ac43d1f18f6a882e2411","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.693353+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}